				{
					"id": 748000801,
					"content": "...Hey! Why are you crouching on the ground holding your head?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000802,
					"content": "Did you hit your head or something? But there isn't anything here to hit your head on...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000803,
					"content": "Shh! Get over here! Lie down next to me! It's dangerous here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000804,
					"content": "Here we go again...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000805,
					"content": "This aquabus doesn't have any kind of barrier on top! If you place two poles on either side, and run fishing line between them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000806,
					"content": "Then when the aquabus passes through, that fishing line will suddenly become a knife that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000807,
					"content": "Aaaah! Stop! Don't say any more!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000808,
					"content": "No, no, you don't even need two poles! One would be enough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000809,
					"content": "And if you hung up some fishing line on it, with the hook just dangling there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000810,
					"content": "Then the people on the aquabus would naturally be hooked, and left hanging in the air, and then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Guijarro"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000811,
					"content": "Not listening not listening not listening... Paimon's not listening, lalalala!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 748000812,
					"content": "After listening to her this whole time, even Paimon's getting kinda scared...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						748000813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
